  "neutron_tempest_plugin/scenario/test_ovn_bgp.py": [
    {
      "author": {
        "_account_id": 31291,
        "name": "Eduardo Olivares",
        "email": "eolivare@redhat.com",
        "username": "eolivare"
      },
      "change_message_id": "f184dd9312196a7d79b24be5728e7bcc5f54c697",
      "unresolved": true,
      "patch_set": 1,
      "id": "042f9bbe_d08a3904",
      "line": 46,
      "updated": "2026-08-18 11:02:47.000000000",
      "message": "I have the impression that all these cleanups are redundant because `create_router_by_client` ends up calling `_create_router_with_client` from the `BaseNetworkTest` class, which adds the created router to the `cls.routers` list (line 650 from [1]) and that will make `resource_cleanup` call `cls.delete_router` for it (line 209 from [1]).\n\nBut I may be missing something, so I'll check the test logs with [2].\n\n\n[1] https://github.com/openstack/neutron-tempest-plugin/blob/master/neutron_tempest_plugin/api/base.py#L650\n[2] https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/neutron/+/1001108",
      "commit_id": "427da208b47889a5c3c2c0c08a504a50d84f0f04"
    },
    {
      "author": {
        "_account_id": 31291,
        "name": "Eduardo Olivares",
        "email": "eolivare@redhat.com",
        "username": "eolivare"
      },
      "change_message_id": "7cd6f1fc0c2e1edbac38fbfcf1f2b5ae36d98592",
      "unresolved": true,
      "patch_set": 1,
      "id": "5a91f974_0c965535",
      "line": 46,
      "in_reply_to": "042f9bbe_d08a3904",
      "updated": "2026-09-07 12:58:55.000000000",
      "message": "I have reviewed tempest.log from [1] and I can confirm these cleanups are not needed, they are managed by the (grand) parent's class resource_cleanup [2].\nThat method removes subnets from the router and deletes the router, so these cleanups are redundant.\n\nApart from that, the test passes, so once these cleanups are removed, the patch LGTM.\n\n[1] https://zuul.opendev.org/t/openstack/build/40a5c116a0cf42ac8b966d7281568f1c\n[2] https://github.com/openstack/neutron-tempest-plugin/blob/master/neutron_tempest_plugin/api/base.py#L209",
      "commit_id": "427da208b47889a5c3c2c0c08a504a50d84f0f04"
    },
    {
