      "updated": "2026-09-07 13:06:50.000000000",
      "message": "+1 to Eduardo's comment\n\nThe router cleanup (admin and non-admin) was fixed by Eduardo in https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/neutron-tempest-plugin/+/1000968",
      "commit_id": "427da208b47889a5c3c2c0c08a504a50d84f0f04"
    },
